      ],
      "source": "https://www.lehightownshiphistoricalsociety.org/danielsville.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Edgemont Park, once a bustling early‑20th‑century amusement spot, drew families via the trolley to picnics and rides.",
